WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.700
What does two to the fifth power really mean?

2
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.873
Five factors of two. Each one doubles the model:

3
00:00:05.873 --> 00:00:09.200
2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 32.

4
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:12.627
The model works for fractions too:

5
00:00:12.627 --> 00:00:16.100
2/3 × 3/4 = 6/12 = 1/2.

6
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:18.825
A graph shows a rule:

7
00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:21.100
slope two, starting at one.

8
00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:25.400
Explore it on eduwonderlab.com.
